Package: amber-odin
Version: @VERSION@-@REVISION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Hyperquader <hyperquader@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: git
Provides: odin-compiler
Conflicts: odin
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://odin-lang.org/
Description: Odin compiler repackaged for Amber projects
 This package installs the official Odin compiler tree under /usr/lib/amber-odin
 and exposes /usr/bin/odin for Amber and kattery development builds.
 .
 It is named amber-odin to avoid colliding conceptually with Ubuntu's unrelated
 odin package for magnetic resonance sequence tooling.
